    "description": "If you're a passionate E-commerce Executive with drive and ambition, Dishis Designer Jewellery Holdings Services in Kanpur is the place for you. We're growing fast and need talented people to grow with us.\n\nAbout Dishis Designer Jewellery Holdings Services:\nDishis Designer Jewellery Holdings Services is a leading organization in the On-site sector, committed to excellence, innovation, and employee growth. We offer a dynamic work environment where talent is recognized and rewarded.\n\nKey Responsibilities:\n• Execute digital marketing campaigns across Google, Meta, and other channels\n• Coordinate with vendors and suppliers for inventory management\n• Create engaging content for product pages and social media\n• Build and maintain affiliate and influencer marketing programs\n• Manage customer reviews, ratings, and return/refund processes\n• Analyze sales data and customer behavior to drive revenue growth\n• Collaborate with logistics partners to ensure timely delivery\n\nRequired Skills & Qualifications:\n• B.Tech / B.E. in Computer Science or related discipline\n• 12-20 years of relevant experience\n• Proficiency in Magento\n• Proficiency in CRM Software\n• Proficiency in Performance Marketing\n• Proficiency in WooCommerce\n• Proficiency in Product Management\n• Proficiency in Content Writing\n• Proficiency in Data Analytics\n• Proficiency in Supply Chain\n\nWork Mode: On-site - Work from our office\n\nWhat We Offer:\n• Professional development and training programs\n• International travel opportunities for senior roles\n• Flexible working hours\n• Annual performance appraisal\n• Annual paid leaves and casual leaves\n• Company-sponsored certifications\n• Salary Range: 35 LPA - 70 LPA per annum\n\nLocation: Kanpur, Uttar Pradesh, India\n\nIf you are excited about this opportunity, apply now and take the next step in your career journey with Dishis Designer Jewellery Holdings Services!",
